EN 16931 - CEN and DIN
======================

This software is an application of EN 16931-1:2017-06 "Electronic invoicing - Part 1: Semantic
data model of the core elements of an electronic invoice" and of CEN/TS 16931-2:2017-06 "List of
syntaxes that comply with EN 16931-1". It uses information from these publications, in particular
the names and identifiers of the business terms and business groups (BT-n, BG-n). The reproduction
is permitted with the permission of CEN and DIN, the owners of the copyright.

CEN and DIN assume no liability with regard to the use of the content and the use of this
application and give no express or implied warranties for it. In case of doubt, the publications
of DIN (EN 16931-1:2017-06, CEN/TS 16931-2:2017-06) provide the official text of the European
standard.


