ZUGFeRD / Factur-X - FeRD (AWV e.V.) and FNFE-MPE
================================================

From the release package ZUGFeRD 2.5.2 / Factur-X 1.09.2 of the Forum elektronische Rechnung
Deutschland (FeRD) at the Arbeitsgemeinschaft für wirtschaftliche Verwaltung e.V. (AWV), published
jointly with the Forum National de la Facture Électronique et des Marchés Publics Électroniques
(FNFE-MPE):

- resources/ferd/schema/  per profile the XML schemas and the code lists the rules load, unchanged
- compiled from it:       resources/compiled/facturx-fields.php (the ids, paths, data types and
                          profiles of the field list - the names of the fields are the package's
                          own), resources/compiled/cii-tree.php (the element tree the generator
                          writes along) and resources/compiled/validation/facturx-*.php (the
                          Schematron rules of the profiles)

