EN 16931 code lists
===================

resources/compiled/codelists.php holds the codes and English names of the EN 16931 code lists,
version v17b, published by the European Commission for the implementation of EN 16931 (as
distributed in the FeRD release package). The codes belong to their maintainers: UN/CEFACT (UNTDID,
UN/ECE Recommendations 19, 20 and 21), ISO (3166-1, 4217, 639-2, ISO/IEC 6523), the European
Commission (EAS, VATEX) and FeRD / FNFE-MPE (the Factur-X lists). Incoterms® is a registered
trademark of the International Chamber of Commerce.

German and French names that no official source provides are the package's own translation of the
English names, the English names of the MIME types its own wording (MIT, like the rest of the package).


